scn 1
# Aura-heavy whole-tick workload (perf follow-up final measurements, item L): two battles on
# Ulasem Arena, each two adjacent armies of 800 (300 Aramon bows, 300 Aramon Smiths -- the
# retail AdjustArmor aura, radius 200 -- and 200 swords) that fight each other at once.
# 3,200 bodies with 1,200 aura emitters packed into the fights, so most bodies sit under many
# overlapping auras; above 2048 units the tiled aura pass runs. Data-gated (--data).
# Timing as a we_timing.sh situation: gzip it as R-aurafight.scn.gz / L-aurafight.scn.gz into a
# --sitdir (the name picks the mode), --warm 300 --ticks 1000 --catchup 0: the army stays above
# 2048 bodies through tick 1300 (3200 -> about 2530).
name aurafight
ticks 3000
seed 11
players 4
weapons on
wanderers off
map named Ulasem Arena
type bow fbi arabow
type smith fbi arasmith
type sword fbi arasword
group A_bow 0 bow 300 rect 440 284 500 329 pitch=3
group A_smith 0 smith 300 rect 440 329 500 374 pitch=3
group A_sword 0 sword 200 rect 440 374 500 404 pitch=3
group B_bow 1 bow 300 rect 500 284 560 329 pitch=3
group B_smith 1 smith 300 rect 500 329 560 374 pitch=3
group B_sword 1 sword 200 rect 500 374 560 404 pitch=3
group C_bow 2 bow 300 rect 73 289 133 334 pitch=3
group C_smith 2 smith 300 rect 73 334 133 379 pitch=3
group C_sword 2 sword 200 rect 73 379 133 409 pitch=3
group D_bow 3 bow 300 rect 133 289 193 334 pitch=3
group D_smith 3 smith 300 rect 133 334 193 379 pitch=3
group D_sword 3 sword 200 rect 133 379 193 409 pitch=3
at 1 fight A_bow,A_smith,A_sword 530 344
at 1 fight B_bow,B_smith,B_sword 470 344
at 1 fight C_bow,C_smith,C_sword 163 349
at 1 fight D_bow,D_smith,D_sword 103 349
